msgid "gluon-config-mode:welcome"
msgstr ""
"<p>Set up your Freifunk node for DOMAINNAME here.</p>"
"<p>This firmware is for nodes DOMAINREGIONEN. For other areas, find the right "
"firmware at "
"<a href=\"https://freifunk.net/en/how-to-join/find-your-nearest-community/\" target=\"_blank\">Find your community</a>. "
"We may block nodes with missing or wrong contact details.</p>"

msgid "gluon-config-mode:pubkey"
msgstr ""
"<p>Your node is rebooting now and will then use your internet connection to connect online with "
"the Freifunk server as well as with other Freifunk nodes around you.</p>"

msgid "gluon-config-mode:novpn"
msgstr ""
"<p><div class=\"the-key\">You de-selected the internet connection (mesh-VPN). "
"Please note that your node can only connect to the internet if other Freifunk nodes "
"with an active internet connection are within radio range.</div>"
"Your node is now rebooting and will then try to connect to other nodes around you.</p>"

msgid "gluon-config-mode:reboot"
msgstr ""
"<p>You will find further information about the Freifunk community METANAME on "
"<a href=\"https://METAWEBSITE\" target=\"_blank\">METAWEBSITE</a>.</p>"
"<p>To return to the configuration page press the reset/WPS button for 10 seconds "
"and the device will restart in config mode. "
"After successful restart this site is no longer available, "
"and this is intentional.</p>"
"<p>Have fun running your node and enjoy to further discover Freifunk!</p>"
"<p></p><p>P. S.: If your node is up and running correctly your router will appear "
"under the name of <em><%= pcdata(hostname) %></em> in about 20 minutes on our map <a href=\"https://MAPWEBSITE/#!v:g\" target=\"_blank\">https://MAPWEBSITE</a>.</p>"

msgid "gluon-config-mode:hostname-help"
msgstr "The node appears under this name on the map. It does not change the WLAN name."

msgid "gluon-config-mode:altitude-label"
msgstr "Height (3 m per floor)"

msgid "gluon-config-mode:altitude-help"
msgstr ""
"Elevation data information is optional and defined as height above ground level which is estimated with 3m per floor here."

msgid "gluon-config-mode:contact-note"
msgstr "Email address"

msgid "gluon-config-mode:contact-help"
msgstr ""
"An email address where you can be reached; the Pico Peering Agreement requires "
"it for taking part. It is <em>publicly</em> visible on the internet together with "
"the node's coordinates, anyone can retrieve and process it. It is stored on this "
"node, and you can delete it here at any time."

msgid "gluon-config-mode:geo-location-help"
msgstr ""
"With coordinates, your node appears on the "
"<a href=\"https://MAPWEBSITE/#!v:g\" target=\"_blank\">map</a>."
